  "body": "Records the verified gateway auth outcome for #2300 (task 13141) in the OpenClaw comms design doc — documentation only, no config change.\n\n## What\n\n- G2 status note (§2): the invalid-caller half of the gateway-auth gap is **verified live** (2026-11-08) — a probe of the tailnet gateway (ws://100.99.113.103:18789) with only a synthetic invalid token was rejected with close code 1008, `unauthorized: gateway token mismatch`. Current main config matches: `gateway.bind = \"tailnet\"`, `gateway.auth.mode = \"token\"`, token via the `OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN` environment SecretRef provisioned from the secrets-manager entry named `openclaw.gateway-token` (names only).\n- §5 follow-up bullet for #2300 updated with the same status.\n\n## Explicitly not claimed\n\n- No real token value was read, sent, or recorded anywhere in this PR.\n- A successful authorized non-loopback call and distinct per-consumer caller identity are **not** verified — #2300 stays OPEN for that remainder; this PR does not close it.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796728999&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7660&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7660&signature=e43da1defff3ce70bd07bed8c70a51d0e3b489f848c9845a1bee04bd2c50e3bb\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7660?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
